{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/7e778dc108e914738b2116b52c29c134.webp?t=1759761003\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monday Syndrome is a singleplayer action roguelike where you play as an intern that's trapped in a hellish office.\u00a0Descend into a satirical corporate hell, battling demonic coworkers with absurd office supply weapons in an endless, procedurally generated tower. Can you survive the eternal 9-to-5?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/15dac07af982bd391917e0194f2cafab.webp?t=1759761003\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/d02d8364bc1c29c60e060edbdb2d4d59.poster.avif?t=1759761003\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/d02d8364bc1c29c60e060edbdb2d4d59.webm?t=1759761003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/d02d8364bc1c29c60e060edbdb2d4d59.mp4?t=1759761003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash fast-paced, chaotic combat amidst destructible office environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305970/extras/64a617ce81dd8a1199cb5734f35284ea.webp?t=1759761003\" width=616 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" au